# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
!coverage.go
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# go.work.sum is generated and not committed
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Frontend
node_modules/
dist/

# Wails embedded frontend build output (generated by pnpm build)
apps/desktop/wails/frontend/dist/

# Wails build output
apps/desktop/wails/build/bin/

# Generated Wails TypeScript bindings (regenerated by wails build / wails dev)
apps/desktop/frontend/wailsjs/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
